update public.books set description_en = $mota$A longing for the poor countryside of Quảng Nam, told through childhood memories; reflections on life and on people; and deep affection for his fellow writers and the people he holds dear. These are his meditations on life, drawn from countless small observations that surprise and delight the reader. Especially captivating are the pieces about books: from bookshops to particular titles, to the people who make books, to book stories from Sweden and Thailand… Shopping, fashion, gambling and, of course, football also appear, all in his usual witty voice.$mota$, description_auto_translated = true
