-- 28 ngam-chuyen-xua-nay
update public.books set description_en = $mota$Learned, rigorous, fluent in several foreign languages and gracefully urbane, cultural scholar Hữu Ngọc has devoted seven decades, now past the age of 100, to bringing Vietnamese culture to the world. All the while he has kept his creative energy and open-mindedness on his long journeys to the “ends of the earth”, gathering and distilling the essence of cultures from all five continents in order to introduce them to Vietnam. The essays in Ngẫm chuyện xưa nay are drawn from his life experience, his travels and his reflections over decades as a “cultural importer and exporter”. They will awaken in every reader love and pride for the nation, and a personal sense of responsibility to preserve, safeguard and promote the fine traditional cultural values of the Vietnamese people.$mota$, description_auto_translated = true
