-- 29 tay-chi-tay-em
update public.books set description_en = $mota$The main character is a little girl whose two hands are not alike. Her left hand is chubby, with short, round little fingers. Her right hand is really pretty: tiny and soft, with slender, lovely fingers. She calls it her little-sister hand, and her left hand is her big-sister hand. Big-sister hand does all sorts of jobs every day, while little-sister hand does nothing; her mother calls it the princess hand. But the girl knows her mother only says that: little-sister hand is not a princess hand. It is a hand she cannot use, pretty but weak. Even so, she loves both her big-sister hand and her little-sister hand, and the people around her love those two hands dearly too. Together with big-sister hand and little-sister hand, the little girl learns many meaningful things about life and love.$mota$, description_auto_translated = true
where id = 29 and language = 'vi' and description_en is null and md5(description) = '4bc1b439ca8b35c4b76f804000f9ff70';

