-- 31 freelance-writer
update public.books set description_en = $mota$The 4.0 era has brought sweeping changes to production and daily life, with a considerable impact on how occupations are shifting across society. Faced with so many career choices, how can young Vietnamese keep up with the times, unlock their inner potential, build a “personal brand” amid the fierce competition of the job market, and make well-considered choices as they set out to build their lives and careers? This series follows experts in each field to “lift the curtain” on the behind-the-scenes world of professions booming in the 4.0 era, helping you understand a job so you can do it well. With a “career map” firmly in hand, you will be able to make the right choices for your future and be ready to take great leaps forward to succeed in whatever career you choose. A freelance writer creates articles and content, offering and running their own freelance writing services. Freelance Writer – Vén Màn Hậu Trường Của Những Bước Chân 4.0 is part of Wings Books’ HƯỚNG NGHIỆP 4.0 (Career Guidance 4.0) series. A Wings Books publication, the young readers’ imprint of Kim Đồng Publishing House.$mota$, description_auto_translated = true
