-- 181 thanh-pho-guong-mat-con-nguoi
update public.books set description_en = $mota$“Tô Hoài knew Hà Nội intimately. Besides his own lived experience, he built up indirect knowledge by reading newspapers diligently and noting down, every day, details of market prices, trade jargon, slang, the ‘fashionable’ words of the day, styles of clothing, songs and games… His observations are witty and sharp, rich in imagery and poetry, especially in his descriptions of nature and scenery. Tô Hoài can be called a distinctive and prolific writer about Hà Nội, in whose work the shape and soul of the city come through vividly and evocatively…” (Hoài Anh)$mota$, description_auto_translated = true
