-- 182 giang-the
update public.books set description_en = $mota$“It is not hard to spot traces of ‘naturalism’ in many of Tô Hoài’s earlier pages, as in Quê người, Giăng thề, Nhà nghèo… Life is sad and laughable just like that. The writer simply writes, and readers may think what they like, without being guided, without any added comment or stance. As a result, a truly miserable situation sometimes still feels light and comic, and so the emotion it deserves, or that the writer intended, suddenly vanishes or is considerably diminished.” (Tô Hoài qua tự truyện – Vân Thanh)$mota$, description_auto_translated = true
